<title>BELGIUM: W. Europe April new car registrations up 9.3 pct.</title>
<headline>W. Europe April new car registrations up 9.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>New passenger car registrations in western Europe jumped 9.3 percent in April to 1,272,100 units compared with the same month last year, the European Automobile Manufacturers' Association (ACEA) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In the January-April period, new car registrations rose  0.8 percent to 4,696,000 units, ACEA said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
</text>
